ENRICH {"name": "lobby", "prose": "It was this massive hotel lobby but completely dead, nobody at the desk. Just rows of velvet chairs that looked faded, almost grey under these yellow lights. The air felt heavy, like a basement after it rains. There was this huge grandfather clock in the corner, but the hands weren't moving, just stuck.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a massive hotel lobby", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 21]], "id": "hotel_lobby", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "rows of velvet chairs", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 21]], "id": "velvet_chairs"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a huge grandfather clock in the corner", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 38]], "id": "grandfather_clock"}, {"role": "text", "text": "the air felt heavy, like a basement after it rains", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 50]], "id": "atmosphere"}]}], "compiled": "a massive hotel lobby, rows of velvet chairs, a huge grandfather clock in the corner, the air felt heavy, like a basement after it rains.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 304, "out_chars": 137}
ENRICH {"name": "highway", "prose": "An endless stretch of black asphalt cutting through nothing. The sky is that weird bruised purple right before the sun comes up. No cars, no movement, just a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind. It feels lonely, like the edge of the world.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "an endless stretch of black asphalt", "origin": "derived", "id": "asphalt", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "the sky is that weird bruised purple right before the sun comes up", "origin": "derived", "id": "sky", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind", "origin": "derived", "id": "billboard", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "it feels lonely, like the edge of the world", "origin": "derived", "id": "atmosphere"}]}]}]}], "compiled": "an endless stretch of black asphalt, the sky is that weird bruised purple right before the sun comes up, a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind, it feels lonely, like the edge of the world.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 248, "out_chars": 197}
ENRICH {"name": "kitchen", "prose": "A completely silent apartment kitchen in the middle of a hot afternoon. The dust motes are just hanging in the air where the sun hits the linoleum floor. A half-empty glass of water is sitting on the counter, sweating. It feels like someone just left the room in a hurry.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a completely silent apartment kitchen", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 37]], "id": "apartment_kitchen", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "dust motes hanging in the air where the sun hits the linoleum floor", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 67]], "id": "dust_motes"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a half-empty glass of water sitting on the counter, sweating", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 60]], "id": "half_empty_water_glass"}]}, {"role": "text", "text": "It feels like someone just left the room in a hurry", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 51]], "id": "atmosphere"}], "compiled": "a completely silent apartment kitchen, dust motes hanging in the air where the sun hits the linoleum floor, a half-empty glass of water sitting on the counter, sweating. It feels like someone just left the room in a hurry.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 271, "out_chars": 222}
ENRICH {"name": "blurred-man", "prose": "I saw a guy standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement. He had a heavy coat on, collar turned up against the mist. I couldn't see his face at all, just the glow from his cigarette lighting up the smoke around his head. He was just watching the dark windows of the house next to me.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a man standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement", "origin": "derived", "id": "guy", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "wearing a heavy coat with the collar turned up against the mist", "origin": "derived", "id": "coat"}, {"role": "text", "text": "holding a cigarette that glows, lighting up the smoke around his head", "origin": "derived", "id": "cigarette"}, {"role": "text", "text": "facing the dark windows of the house next to me", "origin": "derived", "invented": [[0, 47]], "id": "view"}]}], "compiled": "a man standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement wearing a heavy coat with the collar turned up against the mist, holding a cigarette that glows, lighting up the smoke around his head, facing the dark windows of the house next to me.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 290, "out_chars": 242}
ENRICH {"name": "actress", "prose": "She's sitting at a cluttered vanity table, staring straight into a mirror framed by harsh, naked lightbulbs. Her makeup is smudged under one eye. She's holding a script but her hands are limp in her lap. The room is choked with the smell of hairspray and old powder. Total exhaustion.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "She", "origin": "derived", "id": "subject", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "a mirror", "origin": "derived", "id": "mirror", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "harsh, naked lightbulbs", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 23]], "id": "lightbulbs"}]}, {"role": "text", "text": "the room", "origin": "derived", "id": "room", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "the smell of hairspray and old powder", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 37]], "id": "smell"}]}]}], "compiled": "She, a mirror, harsh, naked lightbulbs, the room, the smell of hairspray and old powder.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 284, "out_chars": 88}
ENRICH {"name": "child", "prose": "A chaotic street market, everything moving fast, blurred faces everywhere. But right in the center is this little girl in a bright yellow sweater. She's completely still, looking straight at the camera while everyone rushes past her. She looks lost, holding a melting piece of ice cream.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a chaotic street market", "origin": "derived", "id": "market", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "a little girl in a bright yellow sweater", "origin": "derived", "id": "girl", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "a melting piece of ice cream", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 28]], "id": "ice_cream"}]}]}], "compiled": "a chaotic street market, a little girl in a bright yellow sweater, a melting piece of ice cream.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 287, "out_chars": 96}
ENRICH {"name": "bird", "prose": "There was this bird sitting on a concrete ledge, but when it tilted its head, I heard gears clicking. It had feathers, but they looked like they were made of tarnished silver or tin. It just stared at me with these glassy, static black eyes while the sky behind it turned a dark, smoky orange.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a bird sitting on a concrete ledge", "origin": "derived", "id": "bird", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "feathers that look like tarnished silver or tin", "origin": "derived", "invented": [[0, 47]], "id": "feathers"}, {"role": "text", "text": "glassy, static black eyes", "origin": "derived", "invented": [[0, 25]], "id": "eyes"}, {"role": "text", "text": "sky behind the bird turning dark, smoky orange", "origin": "derived", "invented": [[0, 46]], "id": "sky"}]}, {"role": "text", "text": "when the bird tilted its head, I heard gears clicking", "origin": "derived", "invented": [[0, 53]], "id": "movement"}], "compiled": "a bird sitting on a concrete ledge, feathers that look like tarnished silver or tin, glassy, static black eyes, sky behind the bird turning dark, smoky orange, when the bird tilted its head, I heard gears clicking.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 293, "out_chars": 214}
ENRICH {"name": "dress", "prose": "A white silk dress drifting down a dark, slow-moving river. There's no one inside it, but it moves through the water as if it's swimming. The fabric catches the moonlight, glowing against the black water. Branches from willow trees drag across it as it floats away.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a white silk dress", "origin": "derived", "id": "dress", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "moonlight", "origin": "derived", "id": "light", "ties": ["glowing against the black water"]}, {"role": "text", "text": "branches from willow trees", "origin": "derived", "id": "willow_branches", "ties": ["dragging across the dress as it floats away"]}]}], "compiled": "a white silk dress, moonlight, branches from willow trees.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 265, "out_chars": 58}
ENRICH {"name": "hand", "prose": "We were walking through a regular forest, but suddenly the trees cleared and there was this colossal stone hand bursting out of the dirt. Just the hand, fingers reaching up like it was trying to grab the clouds. Moss was growing all over the knuckles. It felt ancient and terrifying.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a colossal stone hand bursting out of the dirt", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 46]], "id": "stone_hand", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "the trees clearing", "origin": "derived", "id": "trees", "ties": ["the trees clearing", "the stone hand bursting out of the dirt"]}, {"role": "text", "text": "ancient and terrifying", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 22]], "id": "atmosphere"}]}], "compiled": "a colossal stone hand bursting out of the dirt, the trees clearing, ancient and terrifying.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 283, "out_chars": 91}
